# Competition Web App API: every endpoint plus error examples.
# Open in VS Code with the free "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
# and click "Send Request" above any request. Start the server first: npm run dev
# (also works in JetBrains IDEs' built-in HTTP client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050

# ==================== Meta ====================

### Health
# Service status, data timestamp and counts. Expect 200. Never cached.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Parameters
# Label, unit, decimals, group and source of every series key. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parameters

# ==================== Cities ====================

### List cities
# All cities with name, state and coordinates. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities

### City details
# One city with its parameter keys and month range. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur

### Series (all)
# Every parameter for every month. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/series

### Series (filtered)
# NDVI and rainfall from Jan 2015 to Dec 2020 (inclusive). Missing months are null. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/series?params=ndvi,rain&from=2015-01&to=2020-12

### Boundary
# District outline as a GeoJSON geometry. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/boundary

### Rasters
# Raster bounds, image paths (static files on the website) and the pixels link. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/rasters

### Pixels
# Per-pixel grids: NDVI x1000 per year (41x41), change (41x41), LST day/night x10 in °C (11x11). Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/pixels

# ==================== Bulk (website startup) ====================

### Climate (all cities)
# Months plus every city with all its series. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/climate

### Boundaries (all cities)
# District outline per city id. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boundaries

### Map mosaics
# Bounds and zoom of every basemap mosaic. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/map/mosaics

### Map rasters (all cities)
# Raster metadata per city id. Expect 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/map/rasters

# ==================== Errors ====================

### Unknown city
# City id that does not exist. Expect 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/atlantis

### Unknown parameter
# A params key that does not exist. Expect 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/series?params=ndvi,bogus

### Malformed month
# Month 13 is not a valid YYYY-MM. Expect 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/series?from=2020-13

### From after to
# "from" later than "to". Expect 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/jaipur/series?from=2021-01&to=2020-01

### Unknown route
# No such endpoint. Expect 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope
